{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/90b37ca5a5fdc635a29f18f32cf7ed04.avif?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=250 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/636a33c9badabb275135018e8fc921ff.webp?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Axom: Conquest</strong> is a hold-out style Tower Defence Roguelite for strategy fans who love breaking games with overpowered builds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to procedural terrain, fight physics-driven swarms, and master hundreds of upgrades and modifiers to uncover the source of the alien's unstoppable power.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/636a33c9badabb275135018e8fc921ff.webp?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/fbb6ea240b825b4b71afd0c6fe3f83b7.webp?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/b6ab7c281f6e0bc04a79a1b2944e17a2.poster.avif?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/b6ab7c281f6e0bc04a79a1b2944e17a2.webm?t=1765593982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/b6ab7c281f6e0bc04a79a1b2944e17a2.mp4?t=1765593982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build a sprawling fortress -</strong> Protect your Nexus Drill against the endless swarms of <i>Centurax</i>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand your economy</strong> <strong>-</strong> Expand outwards and extract Axom's resources with refineries and more!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/636a33c9badabb275135018e8fc921ff.webp?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/9c5cc79fad5a2b29ffbf831ea5ddf739.webp?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/9bd4e80483daec903fd4f989d63a19b4.poster.avif?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/9bd4e80483daec903fd4f989d63a19b4.webm?t=1765593982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/9bd4e80483daec903fd4f989d63a19b4.mp4?t=1765593982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Relentless Escalation - </strong>Enemies evolve and new breeds hatch as they become stronger and stranger.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Enemy movement - </strong>Enemies swarm in the hundreds and physically climb and clamber over each other to get at your defences.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild Synergies</strong> - Experiment with hundreds of upgrades, from bouncy walls to nuclear payloads.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Alien Infection</strong> - Balance offence and defence as the planet itself rejects your presence. Infected tiles grow gradually forcing constant adaptation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/636a33c9badabb275135018e8fc921ff.webp?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/b2210c46bfd3e11497ff3cbd7617235c.webp?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/4f5adaf76aa4c19875b5f10b66ccffa7.poster.avif?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/4f5adaf76aa4c19875b5f10b66ccffa7.webm?t=1765593982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/4f5adaf76aa4c19875b5f10b66ccffa7.mp4?t=1765593982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Run is Truly Unique</strong> \u2013 Interlocking systems, procedural maps, branching towers, upgrade chains, alien upgrades, unique enemies and game changing consumables make no run the same.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Battlefields </strong>- Each map is unique and strategies must be adapted every run.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Way</strong> \u2013 Pick a Nexus variant before each run, each with unique stats and abilities that steer your strategy to your preferred playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/636a33c9badabb275135018e8fc921ff.webp?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/dbea984f8b3fdb99bdb2f188708003c3.webp?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/350515184ec9208eaa62ea125d036b6c.poster.avif?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/350515184ec9208eaa62ea125d036b6c.webm?t=1765593982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/350515184ec9208eaa62ea125d036b6c.mp4?t=1765593982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not just Towers - </strong>Mix towers, traps, and robot armies into the mix of your arsenal of tools to conquer.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Structure Variants - </strong>Alternate versions of structures that are super powered. Double barrels? Nuclear ammo?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/636a33c9badabb275135018e8fc921ff.webp?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/677fee5e3151321411bab67e02cab598.webp?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/5c02180f5b9890c790d030dfe1077e67.poster.avif?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/5c02180f5b9890c790d030dfe1077e67.webm?t=1765593982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/5c02180f5b9890c790d030dfe1077e67.mp4?t=1765593982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bend the Rules of Tower Defence</strong> \u2013 Alien upgrades and Game-breaking capsules twist the rules. Have a great tower? Duplicate it!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/636a33c9badabb275135018e8fc921ff.webp?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/11a91167d3b58456a5d144f3f87e9f6b.webp?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta Progression</strong> - Progress through a huge research tree packed with upgrades, unlocks, and new options, allowing you to add variety and take on more challenging threats\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streamlined Controls</strong> - Fully playable with just a mouse, with keyboard shortcuts available for speed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/636a33c9badabb275135018e8fc921ff.webp?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/52686289e9c6696b3b15f75885214298.webp?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=58 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/9056536d8de828c795dfb63dd02b3d79.poster.avif?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/9056536d8de828c795dfb63dd02b3d79.webm?t=1765593982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/9056536d8de828c795dfb63dd02b3d79.mp4?t=1765593982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Humanity stands on the brink of extinction after a deadly alien force devoured countless worlds. In a final desperate mission, you are sent alone to their homeworld, Axom. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beneath its surface lies the source of their power, a corrupted energy that fuels their dominance. Establish your outpost, fortify your defences, and drill deep into the planet\u2019s core to uncover and harness this power before it consumes you. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Humanity\u2019s survival depends on your success, failure means the end of everything.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2143600?t=1765593982","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2143600?t=1765593982","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/85491ebf2992b4a38f47d417f5f07e9129f2e16d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1765593982","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/85491ebf2992b4a38f47d417f5f07e9129f2e16d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1765593982","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Adjustable Text Size","id":64},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3514710,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/stor