\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wild Synergies</strong> - Experiment with hundreds of upgrades, from bouncy walls to nuclear payloads.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Alien Infection</strong> - Balance offence and defence as the planet itself rejects your presence. Infected tiles grow gradually forcing constant adaptation.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/636a33c9badabb275135018e8fc921ff.webp?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/b2210c46bfd3e11497ff3cbd7617235c.webp?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/4f5adaf76aa4c19875b5f10b66ccffa7.poster.avif?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/4f5adaf76aa4c19875b5f10b66ccffa7.webm?t=1765593982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/4f5adaf76aa4c19875b5f10b66ccffa7.mp4?t=1765593982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every Run is Truly Unique</strong> \u2013 Interlocking systems, procedural maps, branching towers, upgrade chains, alien upgrades, unique enemies and game changing consumables make no run the same.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedurally Generated Battlefields </strong>- Each map is unique and strategies must be adapted every run.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build Your Way</strong> \u2013 Pick a Nexus variant before each run, each with unique stats and abilities that steer your strategy to your preferred playstyle.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/636a33c9badabb275135018e8fc921ff.webp?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/dbea984f8b3fdb99bdb2f188708003c3.webp?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/350515184ec9208eaa62ea125d036b6c.poster.avif?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/350515184ec9208eaa62ea125d036b6c.webm?t=1765593982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/350515184ec9208eaa62ea125d036b6c.mp4?t=1765593982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Not just Towers - </strong>Mix towers, traps, and robot armies into the mix of your arsenal of tools to conquer.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Structure Variants - </strong>Alternate versions of structures that are super powered. Double barrels? Nuclear ammo?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/636a33c9badabb275135018e8fc921ff.webp?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/677fee5e3151321411bab67e02cab598.webp?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/5c02180f5b9890c790d030dfe1077e67.poster.avif?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/5c02180f5b9890c790d030dfe1077e67.webm?t=1765593982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/5c02180f5b9890c790d030dfe1077e67.mp4?t=1765593982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bend the Rules of Tower Defence</strong> \u2013 Alien upgrades and Game-breaking capsules twist the rules. Have a great tower? Duplicate it!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/636a33c9badabb275135018e8fc921ff.webp?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/11a91167d3b58456a5d144f3f87e9f6b.webp?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=58 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta Progression</strong> - Progress through a huge research tree packed with upgrades, unlocks, and new options, allowing you to add variety and take on more challenging threats\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Streamlined Controls</strong> - Fully playable with just a mouse, with keyboard shortcuts available for speed.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/636a33c9badabb275135018e8fc921ff.webp?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=4 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/52686289e9c6696b3b15f75885214298.webp?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=58 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/9056536d8de828c795dfb63dd02b3d79.poster.avif?t=1765593982\" width=616 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/9056536d8de828c795dfb63dd02b3d79.webm?t=1765593982\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/extras/9056536d8de828c795dfb63dd02b3d79.mp4?t=1765593982\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Humanity stands on the brink of extinction after a deadly alien force devoured countless worlds. In a final desperate mission, you are sent alone to their homeworld, Axom. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Beneath its surface lies the source of their power, a corrupted energy that fuels their dominance. Establish your outpost, fortify your defences, and drill deep into the planet\u2019s core to uncover and harness this power before it consumes you. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Humanity\u2019s survival depends on your success, failure means the end of everything.</i></p>","developers":["Hairy Penguin"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2143600/78a6dff0cf6c7ed8d8d2001bc8c86c1fe31e8a09/header.jpg?t=1765593982","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2143600/2069589861/2456d139f4c32116b86d28b619aebd6db6b08bf6/1763721445/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763722349","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2143600/2069589861/2456d139f4c32116b86d28b619aebd6db6b08bf6/1763721445/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763722349","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2143600/2069589861/2456d139f4c32116b86d28b619aebd6db6b08bf6/1763721445/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763722349","id":257189953,"name":"Axom: Conquest Gameplay Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257189953/823e5dc61582d2ed2498181c93ea211e1b08e793/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763722349"}],"name":"Axom: Conquest","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-7500 / AMD Ryzen 5 1400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 (6GB) / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</s